</person-group><article-title>The communique on the development of the national cause for aging in 2022 was released</article-title><year>2022</year><comment>Available</comment><ext-link xlink:href="https://www.mca.gov.cn/n152/n166/c1662004999979996644/content.html" ext-link-type="uri">https://www.mca.gov.cn/n152/n166/c1662004999979996644/content.html</ext-link><comment>Accessed</comment><date-in-citation>6-Dec-2024</date-in-citation></element-citation></ref><ref id="R2"><label>2</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author">
